				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Shown above is an example of the Meta view one can see when inspecting any Elixir Data. Notice how there is a function tab which shows individual functions. When one hits `Control-s` the source code is saved to disk and the Elixir image is recompiled. and the file is formatted."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
